<title>ITALY: San Paolo stake in BCI falls.</title>
<headline>San Paolo stake in BCI falls.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian bank San Paolo's stake in Banca Commerciale Italiana (BCI) fell to 0.64 percent by May 28 from 2.13 percent previously, a stock market statement said.</p>
<p>San Paolo's stake rose briefly above two percent in May and the bank said the gain was mostly due to trading and guarantee activities.</p>
<p>--Milan bureau +392 66129507</p>
</text>
